{"data":{"id":15,"documentId":"kl97agi6yr1jjq2lt4zulpdg","heroEyebrow":"Our Story","heroHeadingLine1":"Premium leather,","heroHeadingLine2":"made for the ukulele","heroSubtext":"Hand-stitched instrument bags from a workshop that believes the case should be worthy of what goes inside it.","storyEyebrow":"How It Started","storyHeading":"Founded by Musicians, for Musicians","storyChips":["Premium leather","Hand-stitched","Ships worldwide"],"storyStatValue":"100%","storyStatLabel":"Hand-finished","valuesEyebrow":"What we stand for","valuesHeading":"Mission & values","createdAt":"2026-07-28T05:38:45.459Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-01T19:46:42.024Z","publishedAt":"2026-08-01T19:46:42.143Z","storyLead":"Kailo began with a simple idea and a deep love for music. Founded by an amateur ukulele player, Kailo was born from the belief that every musician deserves to carry their instrument with pride, style, and confidence. A ukulele is more than just an instrument—it's a companion, a passion, and a part of who you are. We believed its case should reflect that.","storyParagraphs":["Every Kailo bag is crafted with meticulous attention to detail—from the precision of every stitch to the comfort of every strap and the softness of every lining. Because we know it's the little things that make a big difference.","Today, Kailo accompanies touring artists, passionate hobbyists, bedroom songwriters, and music students throughout the country, expanding its footprint to the entire world. While our community has grown, our purpose remains unchanged: to create beautifully crafted bags that protect the instruments musicians love and inspire them to carry their music with confidence."],"materialsEyebrow":"What we work in","materialsHeading":"Three materials, chosen on purpose","materialsDescription":"Leather has always been a timeless symbol of craftsmanship and style. By combining premium leather with thoughtful design, we set out to create instrument bags that not only protect your ukulele but also make a statement wherever your music takes you.","craftEyebrow":"The little things","craftHeading":"Where the detail lives","craftDescription":"Meticulous attention to detail is the whole job. Three places you can feel it on every bag that leaves the bench.","audienceEyebrow":"Who carries Kailo","audienceHeading":"Made for the way you play","audienceDescription":"Touring artists, passionate hobbyists, bedroom songwriters and music students — the same bag, asked to do four very different jobs.","storyPullQuote":"A ukulele is more than just an instrument—it's a companion, a passion, and a part of who you are.","heroImage":{"id":16,"documentId":"bfvfyea3aqvesmbuhb2kbd8e","name":"lifestyle-workbench","alternativeText":"The Kailo workshop bench in window light","caption":"The Kailo workshop bench in window light","focalPoint":null,"width":1916,"height":821,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6.webp","hash":"large_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_lifestyle-workbench","path":null,"size":38.99,"width":1000,"height":428,"sizeInBytes":39926},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6.webp","hash":"small_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_lifestyle-workbench","path":null,"size":16.21,"width":500,"height":214,"sizeInBytes":16594},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6.webp","hash":"medium_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_lifestyle-workbench","path":null,"size":27.07,"width":750,"height":321,"sizeInBytes":27720},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6.webp","hash":"thumbnail_lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_lifestyle-workbench","path":null,"size":6.29,"width":245,"height":105,"sizeInBytes":6444}},"hash":"lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":95.94,"url":"/uploads/lifestyle_workbench_f373d8f8b6.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-28T05:40:54.451Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T11:50:43.041Z","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T05:40:54.452Z"},"storyImage":{"id":30,"documentId":"tewxq03wv9940v9lc95qhllv","name":"photo12","alternativeText":"Inside the Kailo workshop","caption":"Inside the Kailo workshop","focalPoint":null,"width":1400,"height":2489,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_photo12_e791c278cb.webp","hash":"large_photo12_e791c278cb","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_photo12","path":null,"size":141.89,"width":562,"height":1000,"sizeInBytes":145300},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_photo12_e791c278cb.webp","hash":"small_photo12_e791c278cb","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_photo12","path":null,"size":36.61,"width":281,"height":500,"sizeInBytes":37484},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_photo12_e791c278cb.webp","hash":"medium_photo12_e791c278cb","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_photo12","path":null,"size":79.55,"width":422,"height":750,"sizeInBytes":81460},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_photo12_e791c278cb.webp","hash":"thumbnail_photo12_e791c278cb","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_photo12","path":null,"size":3.82,"width":88,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":3916}},"hash":"photo12_e791c278cb","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":636.29,"url":"/uploads/photo12_e791c278cb.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-28T05:41:02.724Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T11:50:57.816Z","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T05:41:02.724Z"},"craftImage":{"id":15,"documentId":"nchqp94v0zlv9x30w68awzow","name":"lifestyle-artisan","alternativeText":"A Kailo artisan hand-stitching leather at the workbench","caption":"A Kailo artisan hand-stitching leather at the workbench","focalPoint":null,"width":1536,"height":1024,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0.webp","hash":"large_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_lifestyle-artisan","path":null,"size":48.53,"width":1000,"height":667,"sizeInBytes":49692},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0.webp","hash":"small_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_lifestyle-artisan","path":null,"size":19.72,"width":500,"height":333,"sizeInBytes":20192},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0.webp","hash":"medium_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_lifestyle-artisan","path":null,"size":32.84,"width":750,"height":500,"sizeInBytes":33624},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0.webp","hash":"thumbnail_lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_lifestyle-artisan","path":null,"size":7.28,"width":234,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":7456}},"hash":"lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":92.98,"url":"/uploads/lifestyle_artisan_8f13b88bc0.webp","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-28T05:40:51.907Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T11:50:42.576Z","publishedAt":"2026-07-28T05:40:51.907Z"},"craftDetails":[{"id":254,"icon":"Scissors","title":"Every stitch","body":"Precision through every seam, checked by hand before a bag is finished."},{"id":255,"icon":"Backpack","title":"Every strap","body":"Shaped and set for comfort, so a full day of carrying never feels like one."},{"id":256,"icon":"Layers","title":"Every lining","body":"Soft against a lacquered top, so nothing can mark the instrument inside."}],"values":[{"id":257,"icon":"Heart","title":"Made with care","body":"Every bag is hand-checked before it ships — no exceptions, no shortcuts."},{"id":258,"icon":"Sparkles","title":"Materials matter","body":"Full-grain and suede leather, raw denim and brushed linings, chosen to age beautifully."},{"id":259,"icon":"Globe","title":"For the long haul","body":"Designs built to travel the world with you and outlast the trends."}],"audiences":[{"id":260,"icon":"Plane","title":"Touring artists","body":"Bags that survive a van, a stage door and an overhead locker, week after week."},{"id":261,"icon":"Heart","title":"Passionate hobbyists","body":"For the player who practises purely for the joy of it, and wants gear that feels the same way."},{"id":262,"icon":"Home","title":"Bedroom songwriters","body":"Something that looks right leaning against the wall, because that is where it lives."},{"id":263,"icon":"GraduationCap","title":"Music students","body":"Padding that forgives a crowded bus, and a strap that does not dig in on the walk to class."}],"cta":{"id":83,"heading":"Carry your music with pride","body":"Explore accessories built by musicians who live out of a case and on a strap — made to move with you.","buttonLabel":"Shop the Collection","buttonHref":"/products","secondaryButtonLabel":"Get in touch","secondaryButtonHref":"/contact"},"seo":{"id":316,"metaTitle":"About — Kailo","metaDescription":"Kailo was founded by musicians, for musicians. Learn how a love of the ukulele became a workshop making leather bags worth carrying.","canonicalUrl":"/about","ogImage":{"id":17,"documentId":"xn6d8u89593qwbb4f0s3vfvs","name":"lifestyle-ukulele-window","alternativeText":"A Kailo ukulele bag resting in the window light","caption":"A Kailo ukulele bag resting in the window light","focalPoint":null,"width":1254,"height":1254,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_lifestyle_ukulele_window_875307f3a8.webp","hash":"large_lifestyle_ukulele_window_875307f3a8","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_lifestyle-ukulele-window","path":null,"size":93.86,"width":1000,"height":1000,"sizeInBytes":96108},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_lifestyle_ukulele_window_875307f3a8.webp","hash":"small_lifestyle_ukulele_window_875307f3a8","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_lifestyle-ukulele-window",